<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A7.SS5" title="In Appendix G THRESHOLD VALUES SPECIFICATION AND INTERVAL-BASED FACTORIZATION ‣ Support Basis: Fast Attention Beyond Bounded Entries" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.5 </span>Bucketing Reduces the Error in <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> Norm</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A7.SS6" title="In Appendix G THRESHOLD VALUES SPECIFICATION AND INTERVAL-BASED FACTORIZATION ‣ Support Basis: Fast Attention Beyond Bounded Entries" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.6 </span>Bucketing Reduces the Error in <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{p}</annotation></semantics></math> Norm</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In Support Basis: Fast Attention Beyond Bounded Entries" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>SKETCHING REDUCES THE TIME COMPLEXITY OF POLYNOMIAL ATTENTION</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
