<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A8.SS2" title="In Appendix H SKETCHING REDUCES THE TIME COMPLEXITY OF POLYNOMIAL ATTENTION ‣ Support Basis: Fast Attention Beyond Bounded Entries" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H.2 </span>Pointwise Approximation of Polynomial Kernel via Sketching</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A8.SS3" title="In Appendix H SKETCHING REDUCES THE TIME COMPLEXITY OF POLYNOMIAL ATTENTION ‣ Support Basis: Fast Attention Beyond Bounded Entries" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H.3 </span>Union Bound to All Entries</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
