<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A9.SS1" title="In Appendix I ATTENTION OPTIMIZATION VIA MULTI-THRESHOLD SUPPORT BASIS AND SKETCHING ‣ Support Basis: Fast Attention Beyond Bounded Entries" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">I.1 </span>A Basic Definition</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A9.SS2" title="In Appendix I ATTENTION OPTIMIZATION VIA MULTI-THRESHOLD SUPPORT BASIS AND SKETCHING ‣ Support Basis: Fast Attention Beyond Bounded Entries" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">I.2 </span><math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(Q,K\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(Q,K\right)</annotation></semantics></math>-Softmax-Attention Matrix Approximation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A9.SS3" title="In Appendix I ATTENTION OPTIMIZATION VIA MULTI-THRESHOLD SUPPORT BASIS AND SKETCHING ‣ Support Basis: Fast Attention Beyond Bounded Entries" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">I.3 </span>Running Time Analysis of Constructing <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{1}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{1}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{2}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{2}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A9.SS4" title="In Appendix I ATTENTION OPTIMIZATION VIA MULTI-THRESHOLD SUPPORT BASIS AND SKETCHING ‣ Support Basis: Fast Attention Beyond Bounded Entries" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">I.4 </span>(Batch) Gaussian Kernel Density Estimation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A9.SS5" title="In Appendix I ATTENTION OPTIMIZATION VIA MULTI-THRESHOLD SUPPORT BASIS AND SKETCHING ‣ Support Basis: Fast Attention Beyond Bounded Entries" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">I.5 </span>Main Result</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
