<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A13.SS2" title="In Appendix M QUERY AND KEY ENTRIES DISTRIBUTION ‣ Support Basis: Fast Attention Beyond Bounded Entries" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">M.2 </span>TinyLlama-1.1B</span></a></li>
