</section>
<section id="A9.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">I.2 </span><math id="A9.SS2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(Q,K\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(Q,K\right)</annotation></semantics></math>-Softmax-Attention Matrix Approximation</h3>

<div id="A9.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The <math id="A9.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(Q,K\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(Q,K\right)</annotation></semantics></math>-softmax-attention matrix <math id="A9.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\exp(QK^{\top}/d)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\exp(QK^{\top}/d)</annotation></semantics></math> is central to transformer models, but its computation is costly due to the exponential operation and quadratic complexity. To reduce computational overhead, we approximate this matrix using a combination of polynomial kernel sketching and bucketing. The following lemma shows that by decomposing the input into multiple components and applying randomized feature mappings to each, we can uniformly approximate the entire softmax-attention matrix.</p>
</div>
<div id="A9.Thmtheorem2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A9.Thmtheorem2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma I.2</span></span><span id="A9.Thmtheorem2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(<math id="A9.Thmtheorem2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(Q,K\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(Q,K\right)</annotation></semantics></math>-Softmax-Attention Matrix Approximation)<span id="A9.Thmtheorem2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A9.Thmtheorem2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.Thmtheorem2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let everything be defined as in Definition <a href="#A9.Thmtheorem1" title="Definition I.1. ‣ I.1 A Basic Definition ‣ Appendix I ATTENTION OPTIMIZATION VIA MULTI-THRESHOLD SUPPORT BASIS AND SKETCHING ‣ Support Basis: Fast Attention Beyond Bounded Entries" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">I.1</span></a>.
Then, we can get</span></p>
<table id="A9.EGx149" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A9.Ex306"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex306.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\exp(QK^{\top}/d)-\sum_{\ell=1}^{m}\sum_{\ell^{\prime}=1}^{m}\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{1}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{2}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)^{\top}\right\|_{\infty}\leq\epsilon_{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\exp(QK^{\top}/d)-\sum_{\ell=1}^{m}\sum_{\ell^{\prime}=1}^{m}\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{1}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{2}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)^{\top}\right\|_{\infty}\leq\epsilon_{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A9.SS2.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A9.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">We can get</span></p>
<table id="A9.EGx150" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A9.Ex307"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex307.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle~\left\|\exp(QK^{\top}/d)-\sum_{\ell=1}^{m}\sum_{\ell^{\prime}=1}^{m}\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{1}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{2}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)^{\top}\right\|_{\infty}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle~\left\|\exp(QK^{\top}/d)-\sum_{\ell=1}^{m}\sum_{\ell^{\prime}=1}^{m}\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{1}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{2}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)^{\top}\right\|_{\infty}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A9.Ex308"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex308.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex308.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle~\left\|\exp(QK^{\top}/d)-\sum_{\ell=1}^{m}\sum_{\ell^{\prime}=1}^{m}\left(U_{1}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\left(U_{2}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)^{\top}\right)^{\circ C^{\left(T_{\ell},T_{\ell^{\prime}}\right)}}\right." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>exp</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">∘</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle~\left\|\exp(QK^{\top}/d)-\sum_{\ell=1}^{m}\sum_{\ell^{\prime}=1}^{m}\left(U_{1}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\left(U_{2}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)^{\top}\right)^{\circ C^{\left(T_{\ell},T_{\ell^{\prime}}\right)}}\right.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A9.Ex309"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex309.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle~+\left.\sum_{\ell=1}^{m}\sum_{\ell^{\prime}=1}^{m}\left(U_{1}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\left(U_{2}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)^{\top}\right)^{\circ C^{\left(T_{\ell},T_{\ell^{\prime}}\right)}}-\sum_{\ell=1}^{m}\sum_{\ell^{\prime}=1}^{m}\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{1}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{2}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)^{\top}\right\|_{\infty}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">∘</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle~+\left.\sum_{\ell=1}^{m}\sum_{\ell^{\prime}=1}^{m}\left(U_{1}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\left(U_{2}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)^{\top}\right)^{\circ C^{\left(T_{\ell},T_{\ell^{\prime}}\right)}}-\sum_{\ell=1}^{m}\sum_{\ell^{\prime}=1}^{m}\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{1}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)\phi^{\prime}\left(U_{2}^{\left(\ell,\ell^{\prime}\right)}\right)^{\top}\right\|_{\infty}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
